%% RideShare Platform — Full Feature Map
%% Every backend module, every portal feature, every mobile feature.

mindmap
  root((RideShare<br/>Platform))
    (Backend API)
      [Auth]
        Rider phone OTP login
        Driver mobile OTP + device sessions
        Driver email OTP
        JWT access + Redis refresh tokens
        Admin login
        Device revoke / list
      [Driver]
        Profile get/update
        Driving location update
        Profile photo upload
        Registration summary + submit application
        Go online / offline
        Location ping + FCM token
        Admin: list/detail/approve/reject
        Admin: request more documents
        Admin: block/unblock
      [Rider]
        Profile get/update
        Ride history
        FCM token
        Admin: list/create/update/detail
      [Onboarding]
        Dynamic conditional questionnaire
        Question/option admin CRUD + reorder
        Answers submit + fetch mine
        Legal docs versioning + acceptance
        Multi-language translations
        Onboarding config bundle endpoint
      [Documents - KYC]
        Document type catalog
        Country/city/vehicle-type requirement scoping
        Presigned upload URL
        Driver confirm upload
        Admin verify approve/reject
      [Vehicle]
        Driver vehicle CRUD
        Single-active-vehicle policy
        Mirrors to drivers table
      [Vehicle Type]
        Global vehicle type catalog
        Per-country versioned rate cards
        3-tier rate resolution: exact/category/global
      [Geo]
        Countries/states/cities cascading CRUD
        Public lookup endpoints
        Default country resolution
      [Zone]
        Geofenced polygons
        H3 hex cell generation
        Point-in-polygon detect
        Zone precedence sorting
      [Fare]
        Fare estimate single + all vehicle types
        Time/traffic/zone/demand fare rules
        Tax rules per country/state
        Redis-cached calculation
      [Matching - internal]
        Expanding ring search 5/10/15km
        Distance+rating+acceptance scoring
        Redis H3 driver geo-index
        Driver lock service
        Configurable matching weights
      [Ride]
        Request/accept/arrive/start/complete/cancel
        Rider rating of driver
        Ride offers per ring, status history
        Admin list + admin cancel
      [Ride Payment]
        Online initiate/verify via gateway
        Cash collection by driver
        Webhook handling
        Invoice generation
      [Tracking]
        Approach-phase route + ETA
        Trip-phase progress percentage
        Redis-backed live state
      [Trip GPS]
        GPS ping buffering in Redis
        Noise/gap classification
        Actual distance/fare recomputation
        Fare deviation flagging
        Admin flagged-trip review approve/adjust
      [Subscription - driver]
        Plan catalog per country
        Initiate/verify payment
        Auto-expiry daily job
        Gates driver go-online
      [Rider Subscription]
        Rider membership plan catalog
        Initiate/verify payment
        Auto-expiry daily job
      [Wallet]
        Driver + rider balance ledger
        Admin credit/debit adjustment
        Transaction history
      [Admin]
        Dashboard aggregate stats
        Ride/subscription stats
        Audit log viewer
      [Payment - internal]
        Razorpay gateway adapter
        Stripe gateway adapter
        Currency-to-gateway mapping
      [Notification - internal]
        FCM push single + multicast
        Console fallback in dev
      [Infra]
        Kafka 18 topics event bus
        BullMQ scheduled jobs
        Socket.IO driver/rider namespaces
        Prometheus metrics endpoint
        S3-compatible file storage
        Google Maps routing + ETA
    (Admin Portal)
      [Dashboard]
        Stat tiles
        Ride analytics chart
      [Users - Riders]
        List/search/filter/export
        Bulk block/unblock
        Detail: wallet + subscription + rides
      [Drivers Approval]
        List/search/filter/export
        Bulk approve
        Approve/reject/block/unblock
        Document review approve/reject
        Request more documents
      [Rides Management]
        List/filter/export
        Details: timeline + offers/bids
        Admin cancel with reason
      [Ride Payments]
        List/filter by status/gateway/method
        Payment history per ride
        Invoice download
      [Vehicle Types]
        CRUD + enable/disable
        Per-country pricing form
      [Zones Geofence]
        CRUD + enable/disable
        Detect-zone tool
      [Locations]
        Countries/states/cities tabs
        Cascading dropdowns reused platform-wide
      [Fare Rules]
        CRUD dynamic by rule type
        View details dialog
      [Subscription Plans]
        Driver plan CRUD
      [Rider Plans]
        Rider plan CRUD
      [Wallets]
        List all wallets
        Adjust balance dialog
      [Audit Log]
        Read-only filterable log
      [Onboarding Config]
        Document types + requirements
        Questions + options + conditions
        Legal document publishing
      [Shared Infra]
        AutoFilters URL-synced filters
        Generic DataTable
        Global Cmd+K search
        CSV export
        Idle-timeout auto logout
    (Rider Mobile App)
      [Auth]
        Splash/onboarding carousel
        Phone login + OTP
        Signup + forgot password
      [Home]
        Map landing screen
        Place search
        Navigation drawer
      [Booking]
        Pickup/destination selection
        Vehicle options + fare calc
        Ride confirmation
      [Ride Tracking]
        Simulated driver approach
        Trip-in-progress map
        Cancel ride
      [Wallet]
        Balance + transactions
        Add funds
      [Profile]
        View/edit profile
        Ride history + receipts
        Saved places
        Payment methods
        Settings incl dark mode
        Help/FAQ
      [Notifications]
        Inbox list
        Mark read / delete
